<title>USA: Stride Rite Q2 shr rises to $0.14 vs $0.06.</title>
<headline>Stride Rite Q2 shr rises to $0.14 vs $0.06.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.14		    $0.06</p>
<p> Net			  7,077		    3,012</p>
<p> Net sales		141,604		  124,185</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  49,385		   49,870</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHSended May 30</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.22		    $0.09</p>
